# The Full Parameter List's remainder (PLAN.md §13.6 row 82): the Modified filter, the tree's
# collapse, Refresh Table, and Reset to Default's question answered No.
#
# The claims, each the C#'s (GCSViews/ConfigurationView/ConfigRawParams.cs):
# * Modified shows only the rows in _changes, the edits not yet written (:917-931). This screen
#   writes an edit at once, so _changes holds a name from the edit until the vehicle echoes it,
#   and keeps one whose every retry went unanswered (:323-363) - SITL echoes everything, so here
#   it is empty before and after a step; the kept timeout is proven against a scripted vehicle
#   in crates/mp-gui/src/raw_params.rs, a_write_never_echoed_stays_modified.
# * but_collapse hides the tree and drops its prefix, so every row shows (:1134-1149); the state
#   is kept in rawparam_panel1collapsed on Deactivate and read back on Activate (:85, :113).
# * Refresh Table shows with the Planner page's Slow Machine ticked (:62) and makes the rows again
#   from the vehicle's table (:1119-1124). This test's own config.xml ticks it.
# * Reset to Default asks "Reset all parameters to default / Are you sure!!" (:983); No does
#   nothing.
#
# NOT RUN HERE, deliberately: Reset to Default's Yes - it zeroes FORMAT_VERSION and reboots the
# board, which wipes every parameter (the sequence is proven against a scripted vehicle in
# raw_params.rs, a_reset_*); Commit Params - hidden in the Advanced view, and it writes the
# vehicle's storage (commit_sends_preflight_storage_and_says_what_the_csharp_says); and Load
# Presaved - it reaches GitHub, and the file it loads would be written to the vehicle
# (a_presaved_file_is_listed_fetched_saved_and_read, with a stand-in for GitHub).
#
# Needs SITL copter on tcp:127.0.0.1:5760 started from tools/sitl/params/copter.parm. Run as
#
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/params-list-remainder.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

env MP_CONFIG_XML $WORK/config.xml
setup printf '\357\273\277<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>\n<Config>\n  <SlowMachine>True</SlowMachine>\n</Config>' > "$WORK/config.xml"

screen params
window 1600x1200
settle 12
# RawParamWarning, on the Full Parameter List's Activate (ConfigRawParams.cs:92): "Show me
# again?" unticked, so no later visit asks, and OK.
click raw-param-warning-again
click raw-param-warning-ok

expect vehicle.connected true
expect params.held > 1000
expect params.active true
expect params.changes 0
expect params.collapsed false

# Modified: nothing edited, nothing shown.
expect params.modified false
click param-modified
settle 1
expect params.modified true
expect params.shown 0
click param-modified
settle 1
expect params.modified false

# A step is written and echoed, and leaves nothing in _changes behind it.
# This SITL (Copter 4.7-dev) names the parameter RTL_ALT_M.
click param-group-RTL
click param-RTL_ALT_M
click param-step-+
settle 2
expect params.write.name RTL_ALT_M
expect params.write.outcome accepted
expect params.changes 0
click param-modified
settle 1
expect params.shown 0
click param-modified
click param-step--
settle 2
expect params.write.outcome accepted
expect params.changes 0

# The tree collapsed: its prefix dropped, every row showing.
click param-group-RTL
settle 1
expect params.shown > 0
click param-collapse
settle 1
expect params.collapsed true
expect params.shown > 1000

# Left and come back to: still collapsed.
click tab-fly
settle 1
expect params.active false
click tab-params
settle 1
expect params.active true
expect params.collapsed true
click param-collapse
settle 1
expect params.collapsed false
# Nothing chosen in the tree again: the screen's prompt.
expect params.shown 0

# Refresh Table, shown by Slow Machine: the rows made again, the same count.
expect params.refresh_table.visible true
expect params.table.refreshes 0
click param-refresh-table
settle 1
expect params.table.refreshes 1
expect params.held > 1000

# Commit Params is hidden in the Advanced view.
expect params.commit.visible false

# Reset to Default: the question, answered No. Nothing is sent.
expect params.reset.question false
click param-reset
settle 1
expect params.reset.question true
click param-reset-no
settle 1
expect params.reset.question false
expect params.reset.running false
expect vehicle.connected true
